+      <section class="section" id="use-in-ai">
+        <h2 class="sec-title">Use this data in Claude or ChatGPT</h2>
+        <p class="sec-sub" style="margin-bottom:16px">The minimum wage table and the paycheck math on this site are also available as two free MCP servers. An assistant can look up a state's current and scheduled minimum wage, compare states, and work out take-home pay or a salary-to-hourly conversion using current rates instead of what it remembers from training. Neither needs an account or an API key.</p>
+        <p style="margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px"><strong>Minimum wage.</strong> In Claude.ai or ChatGPT, add a custom connector with this URL:</p>
+        <pre style="margin:0 0 12px;padding:11px 13px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12.5px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;color:var(--ink);"><code>https://minimum-wage-mcp.lipmichal.workers.dev/mcp</code></pre>
+        <pre style="margin:0 0 12px;padding:11px 13px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12.5px;overflow-x:auto;white-space:pre;color:var(--ink);"><code>claude mcp add --transport http minimum-wage https://minimum-wage-mcp.lipmichal.workers.dev/mcp</code></pre>
+        <p style="margin:16px 0 6px;font-size:15px"><strong>Paycheck calculator.</strong> Connector URL:</p>
